# GENERATIONAL OODA MASTER AUDIT — Universal First Principles Synthesis

File: openOODA/audit/generational_ooda_master_audit.oot
Status: Complete (Forensic Negative-Trust Falsification & Generational Scorecard)

## 0. Executive Summary & First Principles Falsification Verdict

This report delivers the authoritative Master Audit across the openOODA repository. Six auditor subagents evaluated all compiler, runtime, standard library, test rail, governance, and web platform subsystems under Universal First Principles and the Generational OODA hierarchy (Gen 1 to Gen 7).
Verdict on Baseline Generation 4 Claim: FALSIFIED.
The measured repository baseline is Generation 2.5 (Transitional Monomorphizing Compiler and IR with Analytical Hard Science Modules). Lower-tier hardware invariants are partially encapsulated, but ambient authority leaks, concurrency stubs, and arena data races cause systemic drag.

Core Verified Capabilities:
1. SMT Non-Linear Contract Prover (mcode): Mathematically proves saturated interval inequalities and elides runtime assert branches in generated C99 code (#define OO_ENS_CHECK 1).
2. Bare-Metal Binary Emitters (grok): Standalone System V AMD64 and AAPCS64 emitters correctly handle eightbyte classification and SRet aggregate returns without libc.
3. RAII ARC Memory Subsystem: Lock-free atomic reference counting (chs_rt_str.c, chs_rt_list.c, chs_rt_weak.c) achieves 0 memory leaks and 0 double-frees under AddressSanitizer.
4. Web Platform & HUD: Static site generator pre-renders 20 static routes with Schema.org JSON-LD; canvas HUD runs 7 aircraft generations with zero heap allocations per tick.
5. Governance & Master Enforcer: 12 root process boards obey ASD-STE100 and line limits; 8-Gate Master Enforcer (enforcer.oo) passes 100% cleanly with 0 violations.

Core Critical Deficiencies:
1. Concurrency & Async Stubs: async_spawn/join are mock string transformers ("thread#" / "task_done:"); threads run fixed usleep(10000) no-ops; ThreadSanitizer flags thread leaks.
2. Linear Bump Arenas: Fixed global table of 8 slots without mutex synchronization triggers 24 data races under ThreadSanitizer; channels and actors permanently leak queue messages.
3. Ambient Authority Injection: oodac/c_emit_fn.oo injects universal capability grants into main(), disabling Seccomp filters and accepting 100% of forged capability signatures.
4. Smoke Test Rail: 99.67% of fixtures (12,478 files) are templated stubs with zero assertions; batch execution fails at 73.15%; dogfight test rail uses private mocks with 0 stdlib imports.
5. Physical Gaps: RK4 reuses constant acceleration across stages k1-k4; Navier-Stokes omits pressure Poisson projection; 69 astrodynamics files return constant stubs (return 2;).

